1
00:00:00,206 --> 00:00:02,184
Downloaded your Snapchat memories?

2
00:00:02,224 --> 00:00:06,076
Every photo and video comes
out dated today, with no place.

3
00:00:06,494 --> 00:00:10,038
So years of memories land in
the wrong spot in Google Photos,

4
00:00:10,078 --> 00:00:12,719
and the captions sit in separate files.

5
00:00:13,139 --> 00:00:17,162
Meet Memories Fixer. It puts it
all back, and nothing is uploaded.

6
00:00:17,582 --> 00:00:20,584
Drop in every ZIP from
Snapchat’s email at once.

7
00:00:20,624 --> 00:00:24,270
The page streams through
them, right on your device.

8
00:00:24,686 --> 00:00:28,458
Before anything is written, you
see what is inside: photos, videos,

9
00:00:28,498 --> 00:00:31,181
captions to merge, and memories per year.

10
00:00:31,601 --> 00:00:33,972
Snapchat stores every time in UTC.

11
00:00:34,012 --> 00:00:37,588
Each memory gets the local
time where it was taken,

12
00:00:37,628 --> 00:00:40,318
from the nearest of 7,000 cities.

13
00:00:40,742 --> 00:00:42,687
And you see what every file becomes.

14
00:00:42,727 --> 00:00:46,001
New Year’s Eve in Sydney,
at two minutes to midnight.

15
00:00:46,417 --> 00:00:47,950
One click fixes them all.

16
00:00:47,990 --> 00:00:52,227
Dates and places go into the photos,
creation times into the videos,

17
00:00:52,267 --> 00:00:54,126
and captions go back on.

18
00:00:54,550 --> 00:00:58,996
Every file name starts with its date, so
your memories sort in order, anywhere.

19
00:00:59,416 --> 00:01:02,856
Memories Fixer. Free,
private, and it works offline.
